! ======================================================================
! test_v096_h2o_pbe_rij -- RI-J (density-fitting) Coulomb, pure DFT
!
! Water PBE/6-31G(d), C1, gas phase, %ri j with the shipped
! def2-universal-JFIT auxiliary basis (Weigend 2006).
!
! Reference (v0.96.0, 1 thread, reference BLAS):
!   RI-J total energy:      -76.327207229531
!   conventional (%ri off): -76.327105003437
!   dE(RI - exact) = -1.02e-4 Ha (34 uHa/atom -- the standard
!   Coulomb-fitting accuracy class for def2-universal-JFIT).
!   %ri_check on prints the first-iteration fitted-vs-exact J
!   diagnostic: max|dJ| = 3.2e-4, dE_J = -3.0e-4 Ha at the SAD
!   guess density.  NOTE (v0.96.1): the diagnostic builds the exact
!   J by the DIRECT O(N^4) route and costs about as much as a full
!   conventional 2e phase -- it is a VALIDATION instrument; drop
!   %ri_check for production timings (found when user profiling on
!   pyrrole/phenol showed "no speedup": the check itself was eating
!   the entire saving).
! The default %ri off leaves the conventional path untouched
! (bit-exact regression battery).
! ======================================================================
%method  PBE
%basis   6-31gd
%job     energy
%ri      j
%ri_check on
%charge  0
%mult    1
%geom angstrom
O    0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H    0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
H    0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
